Design Choices and AI Tools Used

Design Choices

I chose to develop a CLI calculator because it is a simple and practical application that can be expanded with additional features. I used a menu-driven interface to make navigation easier and included both basic and advanced mathematical operations. I also added number system conversions and calculation history to improve its functionality. The program uses loops and conditional statements to handle user choices, along with exception handling to manage invalid inputs and errors.

AI Tools Used

I used ChatGPT for guidance during development, debugging, and improving parts of the code. It also helped me understand certain Python concepts and prepare the project documentation. The code was developed and modified by me, using AI as a learning and assistance tool.
